#
# Form 80-320 (Rev. 09/25), Mississippi's individual income tax interest and
# penalty worksheet, for 2025, the latest published: the worksheet on page 1,
# its instructions on page 2, and its worked example on page 3. One anchor
# per line the estimated tax rules fill; lines 12 to 19, the penalties on the
# return's balance, are not estimated tax. Page numbers count the PDF's pages
# from 1.

